# Normalise line endings: the repo stores LF, which is what CI (Ubuntu) and
# the Docker images expect. Without this, committing from Windows warns on
# every text file and shell scripts can end up with CRLF and fail to run.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
